{
  "scope": "What agent.spawn carries and which model a subagent runs on, by how its model was chosen. Claude Code 2.1.296, main model claude-haiku-5-5, 2026-10-10.",
  "source": "experiments/mod-router/spawn-probe: a probe Mod that records each agent.spawn input and next() result, sets e.model when the description or prompt holds OVR:<model>, and records each agent loop's first turn.step model. Run from spawn-probe/cwd, whose .claude/agents defines pinned (model: sonnet), pinhaiku (model: haiku) and plain (no model), as SPAWN_PROBE_OUT=<file> claude -p --model haiku --plugin-dir experiments/mod-router/spawn-probe [--allowedTools Workflow] '<prompt naming the Agent calls, or the workflow script>'. tool_use_id and permissionMode are dropped from the rows.",
  "findings": {
    "fields": "Observed: tool_use_id, prompt, description, subagentType, provider, model (only when the Agent call or agent() passed one), parentModel, permissionMode, background, fork, workflow (workflow agents only). isTeammate, parentAgentId, name and cwd did not occur in these runs; they are in the build types.",
    "hookBeatsFrontmatter": "A3: pinned (model: sonnet) ran on opus when the hook set opus.",
    "frontmatterHidden": "A2: a frontmatter model never reaches e.model; only the result of next() shows it.",
    "explicitShown": "A5, A6: the Agent tool model parameter arrives as e.model, and wins over frontmatter (A6).",
    "hookBeatsEnv": "B2: with CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=sonnet, the hook's opus won.",
    "frontmatterBeatsEnv": "B3: pinhaiku (model: haiku) ran on haiku with CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=sonnet.",
    "exploreIgnoresEnv": "B4: Explore ran on the main model with CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL=sonnet; B5: the hook moved it to sonnet.",
    "builtinProvider": "A4, A7: built-in Explore and general-purpose carry provider { plugin: engine, tier: core }.",
    "workflowFires": "C1-C4: each workflow agent() raised agent.spawn with workflow { runId, agentIndex }; agent({ model }) arrived as e.model (C2).",
    "workflowNotRewritable": "C3: the hook's opus was ignored; the agent ran on the main model.",
    "budget": "next.budget.ms read 10000 in every hook, as HookBudget.ms in the types.",
    "resultModel": "result.model is the full id the agent ran on: it equals the agent's first turn.step model in every row."
  },
